          "availability": "always",
          "forms": [
            "effect"
          ],
          "condition": "Shuri's adaptive technology prevents modification of her Ability Accuracy from the start of a fight; her Shock and Precision effect immunities are separate abilities. This does not prevent the opponent's accuracy from being modified.",
