        {
          "effectId": "regen-rate-mod",
          "availability": "always",
          "forms": [
            "effect"
          ],
          "condition": "Mister Sinister's Molecular Regeneration prevents opponents from reducing his Regeneration Rate. This protection specifically covers incoming regeneration-rate reductions; it does not prohibit increases from his own Combo Meter mechanic.",
